\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Rejoice, O land, in God thy might.
\par His will obey, Him serve aright.
\par For thee the saints uplift their voice:
\par Fear not, O land, in God rejoice.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Glad shalt thou be, with blessing crowned,
\par With joy and peace thou shalt abound.
\par Yea, love with thee shall make his home,
\par Untill thou see God's kingdom come.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. He shall forgive thy sins untold,
\par Remember thou His love of old,
\par Walk in His way, His word adore,
\par And keep His truth for evermore.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

